{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d0_level_act18d0_05_beg","groupId":"act18d0","stageId":"act18d0_05","title":"沁礁之地","storyCode":"WD-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"df78c0071cae748818f5b54b596f7120281d82c72391dc93322a709ebf51a83e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"4上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"現代\n3:32 P.M.  天氣/晴\n薩爾貢中部，伊巴特地區，無名城鎮"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想跟我們走......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該明白，對我們而言，你只是個可疑分子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"檢查過你的隊伍了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"暴雨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......一切正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，說得好，我當然不值得信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"你的目的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的目的是......找到我的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們知道嗎？伊巴特地區的王酋——曾慘死在火災之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是兩三年前的事了。現任王酋是他的兒子，在伊巴特地區引發了不小的騷動......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了那場火，我還不得不重新找個老東家，多花幾個月時間適應新工作，煩人得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，是啊，可那是我的最後一個獵物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"織好了網，鋪好了陷阱，卻沒有獵物，我現在，很無所事事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"——你、你殺死了一位王酋......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢的軍隊會找上你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"——不，等等，你為什麼要告訴我們！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不愧是黑市裡的常客。是啊，除了你們和我，沒有人知道王酋的死和我有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於薩爾貢的軍隊嘛......今非昔比，統治伊巴特地區的帕夏，可完全瞧不上這片荒蕪的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，帕夏應該不會在乎是父親還是兒子當領主吧，其實我也不是很在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是索求他的死亡，很簡單的要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"你的目的到底是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"復仇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個答案太無趣了，所以我從來不會回答。也許這片大地上有一半的人類都有自己復仇的目標，對敵人，對城市，對這片大地，怎麼都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十多年過去了，我一直在做這一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"權力、地位、財富，這些都是附屬品，如果有必要，丟掉就丟掉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，我會全部贈送給，“羅德島”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是前所未有的酬賓了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，看來你還是不願意信任我，謹慎的小姐，你以前是軍人嗎，薩爾貢的軍人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"——與你無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，年輕的“橋”？或者我該稱呼你如今的名字，“懾砂”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"懾砂，他不值得信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......你隱瞞了某些很關鍵的事情吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......是了，是啊，我怎麼把這都忘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們自詡是一個治療感染者的醫療公司......好吧，我就暫且相信這片大地上還有這麼異想天開的一群人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一名感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我擁有足夠匹敵王酋的財富，也擁有能夠陷害一位王酋的人脈與實力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我用這全部，交換一份治療機會，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"——你瘋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我常這麼覺得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但沒有人是不想活命的。我拋棄這一切來尋求治療，難道不合理嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我想暴雨不是在說這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"你竟然連自己是感染者這件事，都毫不在意......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"那你到底想在羅德島得到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，時間也不多了，讓我們坦誠相待吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要找“凱爾希”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許她會告訴我很多事情，也許她會為我指出一條出路......當然，更多的可能是，她都不會做，狡詐地，把選擇權重新交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但就算那樣也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在每一位參與當年事件的人都被我逐一清除乾淨後，我對薩爾貢再無依戀，我迫切地想要離開這塊令人作嘔的土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一個新的開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧在這個節點上，誰會放過一個出現在自己面前的，過去的影子呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......凱爾希醫生和你是什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈......說來話長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是我的救命恩人。我很感謝她，發自肺腑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"決定權不在我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......三年前，伊巴特王酋在旅途中死於一場大火，那場大火燒光了整座城鎮，之後，他的兒子掀起了叛亂，和其他人爭奪王酋之位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"是你做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如我所說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，陳年往事罷了，我只是在本來就滿是間隙的可悲親情之間插入了一些小小的......楔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼想要知道這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在找一條線索，拜你所賜，我不得不終止了在伊巴特地區的調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許這也可以成為你信任我的契機，說說看吧，但願我能幫得上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找一個人。一個哥倫比亞的軍工實驗負責人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在調查哥倫比亞的公司，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為我最尊敬的人死在了一場可笑的意外裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那真的只是場意外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也要......得知真相。何況這也不是那些人踩著我兄長的死往上升官的理由吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......懾砂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，這是我的個人問題了......但機會難得，是吧，“沙卒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，咳，失禮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾乎每個活著的人，都需要復仇，對象可大可小，執念可深可淺。復仇是人生的一個永恆的母題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們允許我前往羅德島接受治療，我可以為你調查這件事。當然，剛才說的所有交易依舊全部作數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是門外那批貨物的十倍數量，我都有管道可以解決，而且價格低廉，手尾乾淨，於一家製藥企業而言，這再划算不過了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......懾砂，抱歉，你的個人訴求不能被算作籌碼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"這我當然知道......我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了......我險些忘了，看來我最近很容易忘事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個老伊辛留下的預言，我從沒當真過。但事到如今再去想想，也許預言其意，只是某種交涉和溝通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，預言......血肉凡胎可做不到與時間平起平坐。哪有這麼便利的源石技藝呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"......預言？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜老伊辛已經不在了，罷了，希望她還記得這個約定吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是否有......多交給你們一枚金幣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一枚薩爾貢的古老金幣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"暴雨，懾砂，有情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"別慌，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......有很多可疑的隊伍，他們在靠近這座城鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"提醒各位，來者不善。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，而且速度很快，如果現在要跑我們還來得及，再慢的話，就避不開交火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"十五分鐘，我們最多就剩十五分鐘，隊長，副隊長，動作得快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"——是你的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢，我如今可是孤家寡人了。人可沒有機械值得信賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，他們大概都是衝著我來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"——該死的，你算好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要嘛幫我逃走，要嘛我們一起對付這些不知天高地厚的殺手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴雨","speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我們要怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"悉聽尊便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，你這傢伙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"——最後一個問題，你為什麼要燒了那座城鎮？只是刺殺一個王酋，有必要把那麼多人都捲進來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至還給了平民疏散的時間——你就是單純要燒個鎮子？赤角小鎮離你的地盤有十萬八千里吧？你到底想幹什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目的很重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"——為了確保你不是一個真的瘋子或是戰爭狂什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，有道理，但我想你不會明白的，我燒毀的只有過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懾砂","speakerId":"char_379_sesa","isRemote":false,"text":"還是你的復仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沙卒”","speakerId":"avg_npc_172_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一場遲到的火葬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_304_hvrain","aliases":["暴雨"]},{"speakerId":"char_379_sesa","aliases":["懾砂"]}]}
